The '''Castejón Metro Excursión Line''' ({{Lang-bl|Linia de Metro de Castejón a Excursión}}) is a [[W:Rapid transit|subway]] line in [[Castejón]], [[Balisca]], operated by the [[Castejón Metro]]. It is a [[W:Circle route|circular line]], linking the communes adjacent to the inner [[Salto Bay]]. The line running clockwise is called the "inner circle line" and the counter-clockwise line is called the "outer circle line". The official name is '''Line 3 Excursión Line'''.

On maps and signboards, the line is shown in magenta. Stations carry the letter "E" followed by a two-digit number inside a more pinkish ruby circle. 

